  "bodyHash": "UT4DLPoJaFs=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tiny Skeletons</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 終於為 Minecraft 帶來了小骷髏！💀 既然有小殭屍，為什麼不能有小骷髏呢？普通骷髏、流浪者、沼骸、乾渴者，甚至凋零骷髏現在都能以小變種生成，每種都有獨特的行為、攻擊方式和獎勵。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可愛嗎？有時候。無害嗎？絕對不是。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自然生成：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小骷髏變種會以 5% 的機率自然生成，就像小殭屍一樣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小骷髏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">先用弓箭遠程攻擊，當你靠近時會迅速切換到木劍進行近戰。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❄️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小流浪者：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">投擲混雜著石子的冰冷雪球，造成少量傷害並擊退目標。擊敗後可能掉落藍冰。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小沼骸：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">從遠處向敵人拋擲蘑菇，造成輕微傷害，並提供獨特的蘑菇主題掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏜️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小乾渴者：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">向附近的目標投擲沙塊，可提供方便的沙子來源。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小凋零骷髏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">出奇膽小的生物，會在你接近時逃跑，彷彿害怕你搶走它們隨身攜帶的凋零骷髏頭顱。擊敗一隻可確保獲得頭顱掉落物，或者用凋零玫瑰與它們交換。🌹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎁 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獨特獎勵：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多種小骷髏變種會提供特殊掉落物，以及獲取有用資源的替代方式。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端和伺服器端均需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可以直接在遊戲中使用模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 中，命名方式為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，取決於設定類型。並非所有類型都存在於每個模組中，甚至可能完全沒有設定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daveyx0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Daveyx0</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 從其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/primitive-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Primitive Mobs</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組中的骷髏戰士啟發了小骷髏的戰鬥行為。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/globox_z\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Globox_Z</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 從其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backslot\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">BackSlot</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組提供在小骷髏背上渲染物品的部分程式碼。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furgle\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Furgle</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 從其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baby-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Baby Mobs</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組啟發了小凋零骷髏攜帶頭顱的設定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-insights\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fast-item-frames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/combat-nouveau\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
